    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CONNIE: Sorry I’m late-\nRITA: Everything alright?\nCONNIE: Yeah. Just overslept.\nBRENDA: Least it didn’t shit on you. They do that sometimes. ’Fore they die.",
      "EILEEN: We done it!\nRITA: First time for everything...\nBRENDA: Fuck ‘em. That’s what I say. Every other bugger round here goes on strike. Why shouldn’t we?\nRITA: Yeah. Just...maybe don’t put it like that if you get interviewed by David Frost, eh?",
      "CONNIE: Go on! Let your hair down.\nCONNIE: Same again for me, ta!\nSANDRA: Who’s next, then?",
      "CONNIE: Never again, I swear.\nCONNIE: Oh-\nBRENDA: Alley-bloody-lujah-\nEILEEN: You’ll go mad, takin’ that up and down...It’s showers all day!",
      "RITA: Maaaaaaaa-n!\nCONNIE: You were sayin’?"
    ]
  },
